      "comment": "northline",
      "content": "Northline is a mid-size B2B software company. HQ occupies floors 12–18 of the Meridian building. Reception and the IT walk-up sit on 12; engineering is 15–17; leadership is 18. Badge access is required above 12. Guest Wi-Fi is Northline-Guest and expires at 18:00 local.",
