      "key": ["helpdesk", "ticket", "tickethub", "sla", "walk-up", "walkup"],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "helpdesk",
      "content": "IT Support runs TicketHub. Priorities: P1 (whole team or production down, 15-minute response), P2 (one person fully blocked, 1 hour), P3 (workaround exists, 4 hours), P4 (request / how-to, next business day). Walk-ups are logged as tickets before any work starts. Maya will not skip the ticket — no ticket, no change.",
